Stdout:
ST108  Response violates schema
checks response_schema_conformance, response_headers_conformance

Response body or header value that its documented schema rejects.

If `format` alone causes most failures, skip format validation while you fix the
structural ones:

  # schemathesis.toml
  [checks.response_schema_conformance]
  validate-formats = false

`--exclude-checks response_schema_conformance,response_headers_conformance`
turns it off, along with ST107, ST109, ST110, ST111, ST114, ST115.
